NOTE ON GAME DATA / 游戏数据说明

`twilight/data/*.json` and `docs/card_spec.md` are extracted from the Lua data files
shipped with the Twilight Struggle video game. They contain the game's card rules text
and board data, which remain the copyright of GMT Games and the original authors and are
NOT covered by the MIT licence above. They are included solely to implement the rules
engine for research purposes.

上述 MIT 许可仅适用于本仓库的代码。`twilight/data/*.json` 与 `docs/card_spec.md` 提取自
《冷战热斗》游戏自带的 Lua 数据文件，其中的卡牌规则文本与棋盘数据版权归 GMT Games 及原
作者所有，不在 MIT 许可范围内，仅用于实现规则引擎与研究用途。
